# Arkivnøkkel: CITATION (fast navn) — Khepri-TSFM v1
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Khepri-TSFM, please cite it as below."
title: "Khepri-TSFM v1: zero-shot time-series foundation models vs. Khepri v1.5 baselines for Nordic carbon-intensity forecasting"
abstract: >-
  Preregistered comparison (design, analysis code and MDE timestamped before any
  foundation-model forecast by an OpenTimestamps proof and the GPG-signed tag prereg-v1, proofs
  archived in this Zenodo deposit; also submitted to OSF Registries 2026-11-02 07:49 UTC (osf.io/hncz5; embargo requested, pending OSF approval)) of zero-shot time-series
  foundation models (Timestral-5M, Timestral-209M, Chronos-2) with the Khepri v1.5
  SARIMA and GBM baselines for 96-hour forecasts of hourly carbon intensity in the
  nine Nordic bidding zones NO1–NO5 and SE1–SE4, on the Khepri v1.5 2025 test and a
  post-release holdout from 2026-10-16.
